{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19174","headline":"和乐天洛下醉吟寄太原令狐相公兼见怀长句 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天洛下醉吟寄太原令狐相公兼见怀长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧相临戎非称意，词人作尹本多情。\n从容自使边尘静，谈笑不闻桴鼓声。\n章句新添塞下曲，风流旧占洛阳城。\n昨来亦有吴趋咏，惟寄东都与北京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}